      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Devil H3 Character Sheet\n\nWire the designer into native MiniMax H3:\n\n| Designer output | H3 input |\n| --- | --- |\n| prompt, width, height | prompt, width, height |\n| character_image | ref_images.ref_image_0 |\n| layout_image | ref_images.ref_image_1 |\n| reference_image_1/2/3 | ref_images.ref_image_2/3/4 |\n\nPicture numbers skip empty images. Leave **Pass layout image** off until a guide helps. The optional Load Image nodes are bypassed until you turn them on and pick files.\n\nSet the CLIP loader type to **minimax**. Use an H3 text encoder, not a Music3 encoder.\n\nSuggested files:\n\n- diffusion: DasiwaMinimaxH3_dasiwaHybridV4_int8.safetensors\n- text encoder: qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- VAE: minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- LoRA on: pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors\n- LoRA off: pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors\n\nThis graph samples 5 frames and saves the first frame. The Power Lora Loader node needs rgthree-comfy. Weights are not included.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Devil H3 sheet"
    },
